好的，可能你还不确定这是低点。你想先看到趋势启动再入场。
Okay, maybe you're not yet convinced that this is the low. You want to see the trend start to happen before getting in.

197
00:17:37,488 --> 00:17:42,688
突然，这里出现另一个比率反弹低点，显示有阻挡成交量。
And boom, you get this other ratio bounce low here indicating some stopping volume.

198
00:17:43,088 --> 00:17:47,488
接着又出现买卖失衡，市场开始回升。
And you get another buying imbalance, you know, and the market worked its way back up.

